and the Authorized Participant are the parties, often with the distributor. The AP must be a registered broker-dealer and DTC participant.\n\n**Irish ICAV:** An ICAV is a corporate vehicle under the ICAV Act 2015, not a trust, with its own legal personality and a board of directors. The ICAV, acting through its directors or manager, signs AP agreements. Regulation is by the Central Bank of Ireland under UCITS, not the 1940 Act.\n\n**Key contrast:** US ETFs sign via a trust's trustees under the 1940 Act; Irish ICAVs sign as a corporate body under UCITS.\n\nFor clause-level analysis, please share the forms.","ttft_ms":6670,"type":"result","duration_ms":7634,"uuid":"9b8b16ee-d32e-4042-a9a3-7278bfc742cb","ttft_stream_ms":415,"time_to_request_ms":64,"first_content_frame_ms":415,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0,"credential_expires_at":"2026-11-28T06:36:39.484Z"}
